      lines:
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
        text: This... no way...
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
        text: It might not be what you wanted. Give it a shot.
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
        text: "*sip* \u201CIt is! This is the drink! I remember it like it was yesterday..."
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
        text: "What\u2019s it called?"
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
        text: "... It\u2019s just pink lemonade..."
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
        text: ...What?
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
        text: Yeah, it's lemonade but...pink and flavored up a little...
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
        text: ... Well now I just feel silly. Either way, this is absolutely wonderful.
          Thank you so much!
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
        text: Really, don't mention it.
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
        text: As a token of my appreciation, I want you to have this.
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
        text: The best one of the harvest. I was going to eat it myself, but I think
          you earned it
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
        text: Thanks, Joe. You have a nice day.
        effect: 0
